Uset
$cards
DECK 4 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
DRAW 63 DEAL BOUVI
BOUVI 5 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
BOUVI 6 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
BOUVI 4 FACE_LAST
BOUVI 6 FACE_LAST
BOUVI 7 FACE_LAST
BOUVI 8 FACE_LAST
BOUVI 5 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE BOUVI BOUVI
AND
    OR
        DESTSRC Rank ascending
        SRC Suit {DIAMONDS, HEARTS, CLUBS}
    OR
        DESTSRC Rank add_13
        DEST Size < 10
DRAW
PILE ALL BOUVI Size > 0
$win
AND
    AND
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
        PILE ALL BOUVI Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL BOUVI Empty
        PILE ALL BOUVI Empty
